{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427450/extras/Wishlist_Banner.png?t=1748977062\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427450/extras/FSR_Steam_Title_01.png?t=1748977062\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plan, Aim, Shoot! FLICK SHOT ROGUES is a super-satisfying roguelike dungeon crawler about lining up the perfect shot to send your hero spinning across the board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427450/extras/SimpleFlick_Optimized.gif?t=1748977062\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427450/extras/FSR_Steam_Title_02.png?t=1748977062\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trigger wickedly explosive combos and blast the battlefield apart, but don\u2019t be hasty \u2013 a misfire could spell your doom!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427450/extras/Combo_Optimized.gif?t=1748977062\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427450/extras/FSR_Steam_Title_03.png?t=1748977062\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Death is not the end! Each new journey across the island will reshuffle the enemies and offer different rewards. Rise to the challenge and adapt your strategy accordingly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427450/extras/Shop_Optimized.gif?t=1748977062\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427450/extras/FSR_Steam_Title_04.png?t=1748977062\" /></h2><p class=